--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 catalogue_check: unknown marketplace craigslist (evo | tickpick | gotickets | ticketmaster | vivid | seatgeek | axs | stubhub | seatdata | mlb | espn)

                                  no id at all                                  
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 catalogue_check: pass the marketplace's own event id, an EVO event id, or both

       catalogue_check_all without an event       
--------------------------------------------------
 catalogue_check_all: an EVO event id is required

     role      | may_call | may_call_live | may_read_log 
---------------+----------+---------------+--------------
 anon          | f        | f             | f
 authenticated | f        | f             | f
 service_role  | t        | t             | t

